+            <dd pn="section-14.9.4-4.12">
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-14.9.4-4.12.1">Because a cache <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> be configured to ignore a server's specified
+expiration time, and because a client request <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> include a max-
